## [3.0.0]
### Changed
- Target the full build of jQuery 4.
- Provide a native ESM entry and a CommonJS factory using jquery/factory.
- Use Bootstrap 5 popovers with an optional popoverConstructor setting.
- Preserve application event handlers when destroying or reinitializing a component.
- See MIGRATION.md for API usage changes.

## [2.6.0] 2024-12-18
### Added
- Specific style can be applied for each event

## [2.0.0] 2019-06-02
### Changed
- Doesn't work with dates in UTC timezone anymore.
  Now you should pass all your dates to the plugin in local timezone, and
  they'll be shown in it (or any you specify) as well.
### Added
- Every location now may has individual timezone offset.
